---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Blog - JTAPS Bar and Grill"
  description="Read insights and tips about sports bars, local business, and dining in Cincinnati on the JTAPS Bar and Grill blog."
  keywords="sports bar blog, cincinnati restaurants, local seo, sports bar tips, cincinnati dining"
  ogImage="/images/6441-Glenway.jpg"
>
  <div class="blog-page">
    <section class="blog-hero">
      <h1>JTAPS Blog</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Insights, Tips & Stories from Cincinnati's Best Sports Bar</p>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-grid">
      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/Cincinnati Wings.jpg" alt="Lent Menu" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">March 6, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/lent-menu">Lent Specials + Our Amazing Outdoor Area!</a></h2>
          <p>Discover our delicious 2026 Lent menu featuring meat-free favorites like Boom Boom Shrimp and Jerk Tuna. Perfect for enjoying on our remodeled outdoor patio this spring.</p>
          <a href="/blog/lent-menu" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/6441-Glenway.jpg" alt="JTAPS Rewards Program" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">February 9, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/jtaps-rewards-program">JTAPS Rewards Program: Get Paid to Eat at Cincinnati's Best Sports Bar</a></h2>
          <p>Join JTAPS Rewards and earn $10 back for every $150 you spend, plus sign-up bonus, birthday bonus, and exclusive coupons.</p>
          <a href="/blog/jtaps-rewards-program" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/Winterland.jpg" alt="JTAPS Winterland Bar" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">February 9, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/winterland-bar">JTAPS Winterland Bar: Step Into the Season</a></h2>
          <p>Step into the Winterland theme at JTAPS for festive decor, your favorite menu items, and a cozy sports bar vibe.</p>
          <a href="/blog/winterland-bar" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/Cincinnati Wings.jpg" alt="Best Wings in Cincinnati" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">January 30, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/why-our-wings-are-the-best">Why Our Wings Are the Best in Cincinnati: The JTAPS Story</a></h2>
          <p>Discover what makes JTAPS wings legendary in Cincinnati. Learn about our famous Pete's Sauce, premium ingredients, and the perfection behind every wing we serve.</p>
          <a href="/blog/why-our-wings-are-the-best" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/6441-Glenway.jpg" alt="Seasonal Beer Selection" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">January 30, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/seasonal-beers">20+ Seasonal Beers at JTAPS: Your Guide to Our Rotating Selection</a></h2>
          <p>Explore our rotating selection of 20+ seasonal and craft beers. From local Cincinnati breweries to national favorites, discover your new favorite brew while watching the game.</p>
          <a href="/blog/seasonal-beers" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          <img src="/images/6441-Glenway.jpg" alt="Local SEO for Sports Bars" />
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <span class="blog-date">January 30, 2026</span>
          <h2><a href="/blog/maximizing-local-seo">Maximizing Local SEO: How to Become the Best Sports Bar in Cincinnati</a></h2>
          <p>Learn the proven strategies we use to help JTAPS rank at the top of local searches. From Google Business Profile optimization to customer reviews, discover what it takes to dominate your local market.</p>
          <a href="/blog/maximizing-local-seo" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .blog-page {
    min-height: 70vh;
  }

  .blog-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #E13622 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .blog-hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .blog-hero .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.95;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .blog-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .blog-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  .blog-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .blog-card-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .blog-card-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .blog-card-content {
    padding: 25px;
  }

  .blog-date {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #E13622;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .blog-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .blog-card h2 a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .blog-card h2 a:hover {
    color: #E13622;
  }

  .blog-card p {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .read-more {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #E13622;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }

  .read-more:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .blog-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .blog-hero .subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .blog-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
